                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty straight forward game where you shoot zombies. It is clearly Five Finger Studios first major project for VR, and to be completely honest, it is great for only being developed by 2 people. It never tried to be too ambitious and stuck to really solid core gunplay mechanics. The story was okay and easy enough to follow along, but I mainly found myself coming back to play it just to shoot zombies lol. If you're new to VR you'll love it. If you've been a VR user for a while now, it may be a little underwhelming. I would say it is a definite buy if it's on sale.\n\nThanks for a couple hours of relief from the real world :)",
